Package: pksR
Title: District-Level German Police Crime Statistics
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Ömer Furkan", "Çoban", , "ofurkancoban@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-3623-7178"))
Description: Access to the district (Kreis) tables of the German Police Crime
    Statistics ('Polizeiliche Kriminalstatistik', PKS) published by the
    Bundeskriminalamt, from 2003 onwards. Data come from versioned, validated
    releases of the 'pksR-data' pipeline, either as published or harmonized to a
    common territorial boundary and offence classification. Downloads are
    cached and checked against SHA-256 checksums; rates can be recomputed after
    harmonization, panels validated, and data releases cited.
